    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "W成功吸引了龙门和罗德岛的注意，把他们诱进了圈套。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的。他们逃不回去。浮士德和弑君者已经破坏了一处防御——"
