    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们将在每一处要害都设下埋伏，用他们的鲜血染红从这里到龙门的整条道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，爱国者也快回到切尔诺伯格了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这样就万无一失了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有什么吩咐吗，塔露拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "————"
